      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然，想找到合适的王并不容易。\n多旺达想要的，真心认定的王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9320e5c84f71456cdc004d0cac8062e494ead07d658bb03195f1ec50a20314aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
