    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c65457f33febff277c184ed5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与多旺达变得熟络起来。如果特雷森学园没有适合\n多旺达的王的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "162718e0fe73a0c9db95e7074487ff4a9f95dc6b996e46fb02be989fbc986292",
