      "uid": "zhcn:df5a3b0b6656603973d1bf14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这特雷森学园中，\n没有谁能够超越尊敬的前辈训练员。而且——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74e33f5cfd8857371d8ad9b8a6815b25de12a8b8ee4dac094cd9420e46086b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
