    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462e9cad668ae29f1c3377de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果一直找不到王的话，『圣剑』将会在荒野中锈蚀。\n那样光辉四射的潜力将就此消逝……所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a194dff0378bdf9e1a52eb08690ae22b8779eec39cfb057a44b91b757a42be41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
